    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks. Just a heads up, the board is really pushing for the new system because they think the current architecture is \"overthinking\" things. They believe the rule-based model will be more predictable and less prone to the weird edge-case delays you sometimes have. Does the current latency data suggest anything that might be difficult for a simpler, rule-based setup to handle?",
